div.p:
1) Treasury would prepare by Tuesday evening (October 9) a contingency plan for
                        US action in the event of an oil
                    cut-off;

3) CIA and JCS
                    will prepare by noon Monday (October 8) a judgment of the military situation,
                    particularly what we can expect in the next day or two;

4) Secretary Kissinger will check with
                    the President on provision [less than 1 line not
                        declassified];
